{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A third/first-person hybrid shooter where the government has turned fate into a weapon. Navigate a world suffocating under prophecy, torn between destiny and rebellion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Game:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>narrative-driven</strong> shooter drenched in existential dread and Wong Kar-wai melancholia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tactile, deliberate combat</strong> inspired by <i>Killer7</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a\u00a0<strong>decaying city</strong>\u00a0soaked in neon and regret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conversations that drift between allegory and confession, unraveling meaning in the spaces between action.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you follow the script written for you, or carve your own path into the static?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566150/extras/asset1.gif?t=1744820916\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Premise:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Five years ago, Leer was arrested for a crime he hadn't committed yet. But fate is a machine with loose bolts, and the enigmatic Moirai have set him free. It's a bleak world out there. Filled with a sense of dread and compounding cognitive dissonance, Leer must determine who he is and how to live in the face of an Oedipus level prophecy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566150?t=1744820916","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566150?t=1744820916","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566150/6712ca174df9aecfd99fd18ba47b88401770f7c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744820916","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.s